<title>UK: SBC Jersey sets 200 mln mark convertible bond.</title>
<headline>SBC Jersey sets 200 mln mark convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC CORP THROUGH JERSEY BRANCH</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SBC WARBURG LONDON</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     1.0 PCT   MATURITY    07.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE  CONVERTIBLE    ISS PRICE  96.50     PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    LONDON    YIELD	 1.74 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) FIVE	CNV PREMIUM 22.5 PCT</p>
<p> CONVERSION PERIOD    AUGUST 1999 TO JULY 2002.</p>
<p>NOTES CONVERTIBLE INTO A BASKET OF EQUALLY WEIGHTED SHARES</p>
<p>OF AXA-UAP, ALLIANZ AG HOLDING, AEGON NV, SWISS REINSURANCE CO  </p>
<p>AND ZURICH INSURANCE</p>
<p>		THREE-YEAR NON-CALL THEN AT PAR.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
